            <i data-lucide="package-search" class="w-12 h-12 text-slate-600 mx-auto mb-3"></i>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-slate-400">Tidak ada produk atau gear yang sesuai dengan kriteria filter Anda.</p>
            <button onclick="setSpecificCategory('all'); filterCatalog('all'); document.getElementById('catalog-search').value='';" class="mt-4 px-4 py-2 rounded-xl text-xs bg-slate-800 hover:bg-slate-700 text-blue-400 font-bold transition-all">
